  (text "SE I2C1 is separate from UI I2C2. Use authenticated SE session and policy-bound objects.\nExternal flash stores AEAD ciphertext with authenticated metadata, version and anti-rollback design.\nSE certification alone does not validate MCU, fingerprint path, PCB or complete product."
    (at 134 255 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "c7c419f4-c1f2-5371-96b0-0ce4399c1c48")
  )
  (text "RTC is a time source, not a security root.\nCheck oscillator/time flags and require trusted resync.\nProtect time changes with device unlock + confirmation.\nBAT is a protected 1S pack, max 4.2 V."
    (at 320 184 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3)
      )
    )
    (uuid "2d5a75a0-9bdf-55ee-96a6-bd0458c7f897")
  )
)
